<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[787]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Pressure symptoms:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[788]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Misca</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>rria</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ge:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>14% compared to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>n</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>o fibroid 8%, more in fibroids of body of uterus.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[789]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Fetal Anomalies:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Rare</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[790]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Dolichocepha</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ly, torticollis, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>limb</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> reduction</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[791]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>SGA:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Serial growth scan recommende</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>d as</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> SFH is not reliable </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[792]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>MRI:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> For rapidly growing fibroids</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[793]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[794]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Antenatal Myomectomy Indications:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[795]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>For severe pain </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[796]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rapidly </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>enlarging</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> fibroid</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[797]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fibroid &gt;5cm</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[798]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Torsion of pedunculated fibroid</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[799]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>trimester mo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>st suitable time </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&amp; it</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>risks</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of peri partum hyste</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rectomy.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="463f7748605096d6b9a48455" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-01-005"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 463f7748605096d6b9a48455" viewbox="3543300 -19050 238125 295275" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="c08ef6dc51d92a699b3934473eb0100dbb4bd1c08c7b4cd1aaa1d0028e07a14c"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-83e90732660c730f7a51" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="83e90732660c730f7a51" transform="translate(3673457 31713)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 137424" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-83e90732660c730f7a51)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[800]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Risks:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> rupture, Caesarian section</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[801]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Recommended:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> in</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Canadian Guideline.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[802]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Indication of Elective caesarian section</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> in previous myomectomy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[803]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Laparoscopic Myomectomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rupture</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1.2 - 6.8% open 0.4%) </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[804]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(due to lac</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>k of multi-layer closure)</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[805]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>reach of endo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>metrial</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> cavity</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[806]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt;50% Myometrium disruption</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[807]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Large</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> cervical </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>fibroids (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>incision is given </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>at least</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2cm away </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>from fibroid</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[808]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">5.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Classical c/s </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with more than </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>10cm </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>scar</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[809]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">6.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Broad ligament fibroids.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[810]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>correct </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dextrorotation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>broad</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ligaments</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> fibroids</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before giving uterine incision</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[811]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>vaginal delivery:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>High-risk Units</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[812]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with no Cervix</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> fibroids</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[813]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Asymptomatic small fibroids</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[814]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CCFHR monitoring</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[815]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oxytocin infusion 24hour</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s ins</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tead of 12hour</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[816]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">5.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ergometrine if no contraindication</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[817]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">6.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Balloon Tampo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nade </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[818]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">7.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Uterine packing if sub mucous fibroids </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[819]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Myomectomy @time of C</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>aesarian </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>S</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ection:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Recommended</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> safe</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>but </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>increases</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> operating</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> time </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>up to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>15min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[820]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>indications</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[821]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Large fibroids</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[822]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sub-serosal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> fibroids</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[823]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fibroids</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> posing difficulty in uterine closure.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[824]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>PNC</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Fibroids </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>regres</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s after 3-6months</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of pregnancy in over 70% women.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[825]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Complications</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> in postpartum period</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[826]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Pyomyoma:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> life threating </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>due to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> inf</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ar</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ction and infection of fibroid</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[827]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pain, fever, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>sep</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[828]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[829]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1.  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>laparotom</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>y</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Myomectomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> / </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hysterecto</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>my</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[830]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   2.  CT guided drainage</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[831]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Rupture of </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>myoma</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in post-partum </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>period</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[832]"> </p>', 0);

