<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1172]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>1. complementary Therapies:</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1173]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ried where hormonal treatment</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C/I</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1174]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Mg+, Ca+</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>vit D</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> conflicting evidence</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1175]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>itex =&gt; Evidence available.</span></span></div>
