<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1185]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Drosperinone = 3mg + Eth</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nyl Estradiol = 20</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>µ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1186]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">o</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>YAZ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: 3mg/30</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>µ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1187]" style="margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - low dose OCP 24/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1188]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">o</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Yasmin: 3mg/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>0</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>µ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1189]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Percutaneous Estradiol:</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1190]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Along with endometrial protection</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1191]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Implants unlicensed in UK for PMS</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1192]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contraception should be given with implants</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1193]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> where oral E is C/I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>like Pts with RF for VTE</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1194]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Endometrial protection</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1195]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Norethisterone 2.5mg</strong></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1196]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Micronized progesterone</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>,</strong></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1197]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>O</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ral</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> 100-200</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>µ</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>g </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>(D17-D2</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>8 or</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> for 10-12days)</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>, act as diuretic also improve PMS symptoms.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1198]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>vaginal</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> avoid psychoactive metabol</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ite</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> formation like </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Allopregnanolone (ALLO)</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>so </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>considered</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> first line.</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1199]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>LNG</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>–</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> ius</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>52m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> low levels of LNG can initially produce</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> PMS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> type </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>side </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Effect</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and bleeding problems</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1200]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>4.</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Danazol: </strong></em></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1201]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>low dose 200mg B.D</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for Breast symptoms </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1202]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Androgenic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> S/E </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1203]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>effective contraception while on danazol to avoid fetal effects</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1204]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>5.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>GnRH Analogues:</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1205]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>highly effective 60-75%</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1206]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not recommended routinely</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1207]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Given</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>severe PMS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or for</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> diagnosis</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1208]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dd-back Therapy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>if GnRH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> given &gt; 6months</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in the form of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> CCT or Tibolone</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1209]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dexa scan </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>yearly in women with treatment on GnRH analogues.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1210]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>6.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>SSRI</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>severe</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> PMS:</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1211]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Luteal phase or continuous.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1212]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>effective for physical/psychological symptoms</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1213]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S/E: Nausea, insomnia, somnolence, Fatigue, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>loss of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>libido</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1214]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Withdrawal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>symptoms:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> headache, Fatigue, dizziness, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>paresthesia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, sleep disturbance.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Gradual withdrawal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>recommended</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1215]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>limited data on pregnancy.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1216]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cardiac defect reported so stop before pregnancy. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1217]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>7.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>SNRI</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1218]" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>venlafaxine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> PMDD pre</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>menstrual</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dysphoric disorder.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1219]" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>8.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Spironolactone</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1220]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>improvement in mood, </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1221]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>effective in bloating, edema, fluid retention type symptoms</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1222]" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>9.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Surgical t/m; TAH = BSO</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1223]" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> when:</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1224]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Medical</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> treatment failed</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1225]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Long term GnRH analogues required</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1226]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Other gynaecological conditions indicating surgery</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1227]" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>GnRH Analogues must be </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>tried as test of curse</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before surgery. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1228]" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HRT before </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>45yrs if TAH</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + BSO done for PMS.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1229]" style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Testosterone after oophorectomy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1230]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pre 1st line:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1231]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Exercise</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CBT</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>B-6</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(offered to all)</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1232]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>1st line: </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=&gt; Mild symptoms</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1233]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>COC</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1234]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Low dose SSRI 10 – 20mg</strong></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1235]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Citalopram</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – luteal or continuous </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1236]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Escitalopram – luteal or continuous</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1237]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>2nd line: </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1238]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Indications: </strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1239]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Failed 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1240]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe symptoms</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1241]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Suicidal thoughts</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1242]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Work off</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> from work</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1243]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Family sufferings</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1244]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fx of VTE </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>even on mild symptoms</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1245]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Personal R.F for VTE</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1246]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Estradiol Patch 100</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>µ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g + oral/vaginal micronized progesterone 100-200mg</span></span></div>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, "order") VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-01-012-1', 't-mm-01-012', 'document_html', '<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1247]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>D 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-28 or</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1248]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LNG-IUS</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1249]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>High dose SSRi 20-40mg., </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1250]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>continuous or luteal phase </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1251]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(not prescribe by gynecologist, if required Refer to Mental health professional).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1252]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>3rd line:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1253]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>GnRH Analogous + Add-Back HRT</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1254]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>CCT</strong></em></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1255]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>50-100</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>µ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g E patch + micronized progestogen</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1256]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Or 2-4 doses of E Gel + micronized progestogen</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1257]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Tibolone</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1258]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2.5mg </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1259]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>4th line:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1260]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TAH + BSO + HRT</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1261]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT decides about surgery</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1262]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1263]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1264]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>', 1);

