<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1432]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Complete drainage @ 3-5 days.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1433]"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1434]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Transverse vaginal septum</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em> </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(1/30,000 – 1/50,000)</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1435]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Upper</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> (</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>A)</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>most</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> common 46%</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="10768c1c10552924c35a71ee" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-01-018"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 10768c1c10552924c35a71ee" viewbox="-9525 -9525 2514600 2114550" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="3b739fb9e247fd5070b9450d127f26f8b6936c39877a4f4dbc2515e4fc85083e"><defs><clippath id="clip-5b8b6a961a8bf9e3434d" clippathunits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 0 0 L 2491740 0 L 2491740 2089150 L 0 2089150 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="5b8b6a961a8bf9e3434d" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-5b8b6a961a8bf9e3434d)"><image href="/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/c90a636b35f511f58801ebc76d9b9506f9fe31daa4affc7eee7bea1a1d638d4a.jfif" x="0" y="0" width="2491740" height="2089150" preserveaspectratio="none"></image><path d="M 0 0 L 2491740 0 L 2491740 2089150 L 0 2089150 Z" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1437]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1438]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1439]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Resection +</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>end to end</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nastomosis </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>followed by</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> insertion of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>u</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lds</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for 3-6</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>months</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>risk of damage to bladder </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>and rectum</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1440]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of stenosis if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oulds</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> are</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> not used or sexually inactive</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1441]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pregnancy </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rate </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>only</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>20% following t/m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> due to tubal damage that</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> has been </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>occurred</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> by hematosalpinx </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>and e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ndometriosis d/t Backflow of b</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lood</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1442]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c-section is recommended</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1443]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Middle</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> (B)</strong></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1444]" style="margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>30-40%</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of transverse septum</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1445]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pregnancy rate 40%</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1446]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c/s is recommended</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1447]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Lower</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> (C)</strong></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1448]" style="margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>15-20%</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of septum</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1449]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pregnancy rate 100%</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1450]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pinkish bulge </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1451]" style="margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>t/m: </strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1452]" style="padding-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Resection + Anastomosis + Moulds for 10days</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1453]" style="padding-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Normal delivery is recommended</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1454]" style="margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> the</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> vaginal septa are managed @ tertiary care level</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1455]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Longitudinal Vaginal Septum:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1456]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Longitudinal fusion defects.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1457]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Can b</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>partial or complete</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1458]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Can be high or low</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1459]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Presentation:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1460]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>abdominal pain </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1461]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Worsening dysmenorrhea</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1462]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Menstruation can be present – from communicating hemi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>vaginum. </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1463]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Haematocolpus + hematometra – from closed side</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1464]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Uterus Didelp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hys</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt; obstetric complications.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1465]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>t/m:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Excision</span></p>
