<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2273]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not evaluated.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2274]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Assessment of Fertility:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2275]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>When</strong></em></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2276]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 year without known factors.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2277]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6 cycles of I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>U</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2278]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Earlier</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> if:</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2279]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Age</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt;35</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2280]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Cause</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>fertility present.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2281]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Predispo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ing factors.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2282]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment is planed that can cause infertility.</span></span></div>
