<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2352]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2353]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Man HiV positive:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2354]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Minimal risk of transmission.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2355]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No sperm washing. </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2356]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pre – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>expos</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ur</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e prophylaxis.</span></span></div>
