n font-size="12">conception.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="97.75" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">Tubal Cauterization </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="110.7" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">or canulation in </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="2" x="43.2" y="123.65" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">proximal blockade</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="144.6" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="166.55" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="188.5" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">salpingography + </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="201.45" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">selective catheter</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="2" x="43.2" y="214.4" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">ization or.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="235.35" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">Hysteroscopy tubal </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="248.3" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">cannulation</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="269.25" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">Salpingectomy </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="282.2" text-anchor="start" xml:sp