/g></svg></figure>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="60716b86390e04d623b0e92a" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-02-005"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="CC resistance:Move to 2nd line2nd line:ovarian drillingCC + Metformin if not Given before.GonadotrophinsRoutine USG Monitoring To rule outOHSSMultiple Pregnancy.PCOS: Who are given Gonadotrophins should avoid GnRH Analogues due to risk of OHSS &amp; it does not improve pregnancy rate.GH NR.hyperprolactinemia: Dopamine agonists.letrozole not licensed for OI in UK.CC resistance = no ovulation with ccCC failure = no pregnancy despite ovulation" viewbox="2886075 47625 3400425 4943475" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="c388ab61826847e443ae4984d9fa20bea79f913dcdbdb30384192c4343685ef2"><g data-mm-object-id="cb82d026fc088c2b8e41" transform="translate(2892056 51509)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 3391786 0 L 3391786 4939553 L 0 4939553 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="none" stroke-opacity="0" stroke-width="6350"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="12" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">CC resistance:</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="25.95" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">Move to 2</tspan><tspan font-size="12" baseline-shift="super">nd</tspan><tspan font-size="12"> line</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="39.9" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700" font-style="italic" text-decoration="underline">2</tspan><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700" font-style="italic" text-decoration="underline" baseline-shift="super">nd</tspan><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700" font-style="italic" text-decoration="underline"> line:</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="53.85" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700">ovarian drilling</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="66.8" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700">CC + Metformin</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="79.75" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700"> if not Given before.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="92.7" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700">Gonadotrophins</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="105.65" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">Routine USG Monitoring </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="118.6" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700">To rule out</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="131.55" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">OHSS</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="144.5" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">Multiple Pregnancy.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="157.45" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700">PCOS:</tspan><tspan font-size="12"> Who are given Gonadotrophins </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="170.4" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">should avoid GnRH Analogues due to </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="2" x="43.2" y="183.35" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">risk of OHSS &amp; it does not improve </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="3" x="43.2" y="196.3" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">pregnancy rate.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="209.25" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700">GH</tspan><tspan font-size="12"> NR.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="222.2" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" font-weight="700">hyperprolactinemia: </tspan><tspan font-size="12">Dopamine agonists.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="235.15" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">letrozole not licensed for OI in UK.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="248.1" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">CC resistance = no ovulation with cc</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="261.05" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">CC failure = no pregnancy despite </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="274" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">ovulation</tspan></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>
