<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2447]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Don’t offer IUI</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (Stimulated or unstimulated):</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2448]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mild male factors</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="3cf1b3dc87a8b8bc44be45dd" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-02-006"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Offer IVF after 2 years." viewbox="2390775 28575 1552575 552450" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="0cd1320476d4172af8851f8f1f57cf167599dce5207ffd0ed5bf23c21010d58c"><g data-mm-object-id="505a08722bd78ff7e1a8" transform="translate(2477562 40785)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 45719 3809.76427 L 45719 493901.23573 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 0 497711 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path><path d="M 0 0 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 45719 3809.76427 L 45719 493901.23573 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 0 497711" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id="0c48731aac2d7c39a717" transform="translate(2395630 86778)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1545220 0 L 1545220 486137 L 0 486137 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="none" stroke-opacity="0" stroke-width="6350"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="12" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" fill="#2F5496">Offer IVF </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="24.95" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" fill="#2F5496">after 2 </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="2" x="43.2" y="37.9" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" fill="#2F5496">years.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="58.85" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2449]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Endometriosis</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2450]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unexplained </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2451]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Except</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> people have social, cultural &amp; religious objections to IVF.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2452]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Donor insemination:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2453]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2454]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Indications:</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2455]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tructed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Azo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ospermia</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2456]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Non obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tructed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>azo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ospermia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2457]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe male factor.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2458]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of transmission of genetic disorder</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2459]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">5.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of transmission of infection to women/offspring from male.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2460]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">6.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>iso</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>immu</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nization</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> RH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>incompatibility</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2461]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Steps in IUI:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2462]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Screening of sperms.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2463]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Assessment of women.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2464]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ovulation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Assessment</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2465]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tubal assessment after 3 cycles.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2466]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">5.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ovulating women =&gt; unstimulated IUI </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>for</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 6 cycles.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2467]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">6.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Total 6 cycles are offered</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2468]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Counselling </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>by </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>independent person.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2469]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Oocyte Donation:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2470]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Indications:</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2471]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>POF</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2472]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gonadal dysgenesis </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>turner syndrome</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2473]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bilateral </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oophorectomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2474]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>OF after chemo/Radio</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2475]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">5.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Certain cases of IVF failure.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2476]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Screening </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>– genetic/infections </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>disease</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2477]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Genetics issues in ICSI:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2478]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Appropriate </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>genetic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> co</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>unse</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>l</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>l</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ing </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2479]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe male </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>factor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>offer karyotyping</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2480]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Non obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tructive</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>azoospermia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – ka</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ryo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>typing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2481]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Y – microdeletion testing X.</span></span></div>', 0);

