<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="3cef4141bd1742c15a1f5a7f" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-02-008"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 3cef4141bd1742c15a1f5a7f" viewbox="1285875 -9525 1866900 609600" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="1044d0f8ecce273a44f48b2b4950ed8d627afdf90f715f8aa7c895c3d7552122"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-51fa7a8c083e8af01787" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker><marker id="arrow-end-567745ccea444781c1ec" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="51fa7a8c083e8af01787" transform="translate(1331137 114372)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(189238 4542) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(-189238 -4542)"><path d="M 0 0 L 378476 9084" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-51fa7a8c083e8af01787)"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id="567745ccea444781c1ec" transform="translate(2759056 92508)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 279925 406987" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-567745ccea444781c1ec)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2572]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2573]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2574]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>follicular Monitoring:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2575]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>aseline scan before FSH to ensure Pituitary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> suppression.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2576]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> week after FSH – to decide date for oocyte retrieval.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2577]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>12 – 36 hours of maturation trigger – to assess final </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>no</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and size of follicle.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2578]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>4.</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Follicular final maturation trigger.</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2579]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After satisfactory controlled ovarian stimulation is achieved – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pituitary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> down regulation is discontinued &amp; hormone </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mimicking LH sur</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ge</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is given to facilitate final follicular maturation.</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="c5dfed4cc27d45f22169ffbe" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-02-008"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure c5dfed4cc27d45f22169ffbe" viewbox="2314575 1219200 257175 476250" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="8fef9006f76ff48042b074f9afb0a548bc4a2bd2e6ec94ccfdd096be5ab5a4d1"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-25c7cc718f237ef81552" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="25c7cc718f237ef81552" transform="translate(2444369 1269365)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 4234 321733" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-25c7cc718f237ef81552)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2580]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2581]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Resumption of meiosis</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="f791d1dc53c0549ccc15593e" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-02-008"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure f791d1dc53c0549ccc15593e" viewbox="1866900 104775 247650 476250" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="0371edb8d54807a38b201d5f0c8befd0e4b0cb41ce79b068844308354085b450"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-7edd77fb55bc21845e56" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="7edd77fb55bc21845e56" transform="translate(1989667 150707)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 4234 321733" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-7edd77fb55bc21845e56)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2582]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2583]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>L</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>uteinization</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="3f8a3a314c404bd79cdcfce1" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-02-008"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 3f8a3a314c404bd79cdcfce1" viewbox="1847850 114300 257175 476250" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="06ecf082f9e5bd2f9544c223ae7351817c5f9f551d7c027a8170bea0f23cb468"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-885e16ec143b5c5e8a41" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="885e16ec143b5c5e8a41" transform="translate(1976966 158962)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 4234 321733" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-885e16ec143b5c5e8a41)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, "order") VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-02-008-1', 't-mm-02-008', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2584]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2585]" style="margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Formation of corpus luteum.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2586]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Triggers:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2587]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urinary HCG 5000 – 10,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>000 IU.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2588]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dual trigger (HCG 1500 + GnRH A) to reduce risk of OHSS.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2589]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Kisspeptin – research</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> setting</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2590]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>OHSS:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2591]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em>can be reduced by the following factors:</em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2592]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid HCG trigger for final follicular maturation.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2593]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Give GnRH A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in GnRH ant</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>agonist</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> cycles as maturation trigger.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2594]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dual trigger, small dose of HCG 1500IU + GnRH agonists A in GnRH antagonist’s protocols</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2595]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Kisspeptin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2596]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Under research</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2597]" style="margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2598]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 38.4pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>5. </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Oocyte Retrieval:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2599]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 56.4pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TVS approach – Gold std</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> under conscious sedation.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2600]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 56.4pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TAS/lap</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>aroscopy if TVS failed</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2601]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 56.4pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oocyte flushing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> not offered if 3 oocytes – as it doesn’t improve success.</span></span></div>
