<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2802]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Age:</strong></em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2803]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fertility </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>eclines</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> after 50 years – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>abnormalities</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>sperm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> increase</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> after 50 years so Age for sperm donation 40 – 45 years.</span></p>
