<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2934]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mild </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>gonorrhea, chlamydia can cause</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> ciliary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>functi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>on defect despite patent tubes</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2935]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">5.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Fertilization defects:</strong></em></span></span></div>
