<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2943]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anti-thyroid, anti-nuclear</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, Anti-ovarian, anti-smooth muscles</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> antibodies</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, APLs –</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>are associated with unexplained subfertility,</span></span></div>
