<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="c0b4a7e9a3c97fd571f3f58b" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-02-016"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure c0b4a7e9a3c97fd571f3f58b" viewbox="752475 -66675 257175 295275" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="275b2b57e48f21fe0e1c39fef088751e084b66541f7d8dc669cff60f20a6d846"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-852fa6e4f0d6b37c9b67" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="852fa6e4f0d6b37c9b67" transform="translate(880533 24130)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(2117 65617) rotate(0) scale(-1 -1) translate(-2117 -65617)"><path d="M 0 0 L 4234 131234" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-852fa6e4f0d6b37c9b67)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3343]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contact details should be provided</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3344]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Avoid NSAIDS, </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3345]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>aracetamol</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, Opioids are given to relive pain.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3346]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- follow up: 2 – 3 days </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3347]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Worsening signs = </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>urgent review</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3348]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Lab investigations: repeated if worsening signs.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3349]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- paracentesis: OPD </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Basis (TAS, TVS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3350]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- GnR</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>H</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Ant, Dopamine agonist insufficient evidence but beneficial role.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3351]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- VTE prophylaxis in mod</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>erate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> OHSS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stocking or LMWH if risk factor for VTE present.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3352]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Hospital Admission Criteria:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3353]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Critical OHSS + Severe OHSS (selected)</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3354]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unable to come for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>follow up</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3355]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unable to achieve pain control</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3356]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unable to take oral fluids due to NV</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3357]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">5.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Worsening signs.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3358]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Severe OHSS:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3359]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Clinical Ascites </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>+</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Hydrothorax.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3360]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oliguria (&lt;300ml/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>D</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or &lt;30ml/hour).</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3361]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HCT &gt; 0.45</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3362]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Na &lt;135</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="e5f5128ccf5942a6cbc0bd13" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-02-016"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure e5f5128ccf5942a6cbc0bd13" viewbox="742950 -28575 228600 304800" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="671cc9be19aa732b237122452e3c1510e41fd1c2ba161aa4ecb8e16c69153562"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-2ecbd17e0bea60ea6b1a" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="2ecbd17e0bea60ea6b1a" transform="translate(863600 20532)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 143934" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-2ecbd17e0bea60ea6b1a)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3363]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Osmolality &lt;282</span></span></div>
