<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3955]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>    </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Chemical peritonitis due to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dermoid cyst 0.2%</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Peritoneal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lavage</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> by cold fluids</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></p>
