<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3987]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 CA colon + 1 CA Bladder </span></p>
