<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="d62ede63e76508b945c4bace" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-03-004"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="MDT ReviewHigh likelihood Of malignancy ofOvaryLaparotomy Staging by Oncologist include:1. laparotomy with clear documentation.2. cytology of washing/Ascites3.TAH + BSO + omentectomy.4. Biopsy from suspicious areas.5. may include pelvic/abdomen, para-aortic lymphadenectomy. BOT =&gt; Staging laparotomy by oncologist/ Gynaecologist according to MDT review.Cyst Aspiration:25% sensitivity of cytological examinationTo control symptoms if Pt is unfit for surgery.25% recurrence in 1 year after aspiration.New 2025 Update:Simple, unilateral, unilocular, Cystic lesion of &lt; 3cm do not require routine follow up. " viewbox="4600575 38100 2952750 5838825" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="0bf748822a2afd1c23baa046f154fbf6b587472637c28afcb853a850ef7aafd2"><g data-mm-object-id="9bb5bafbaf706aec977c" transform="translate(4603750 40640)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 2942166 0 L 2942166 5829300 L 0 5829300 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="none" stroke-opacity="0" stroke-width="6350"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="115.83330709" y="10" text-anchor="middle" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">MDT Review</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="31.62503937" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="51.57503937" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">High likelihood </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="63.20007874" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">Of malignancy of</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="74.82511811" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">Ovary</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="88.45015748" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="108.40015748" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">Laparotomy </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="120.02519685" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">Staging by </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="131.65023622" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">Oncologist include:</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="143.27527559" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">1. laparotomy with clear documentation.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="154.90031496" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">2. cytology of washing/Ascites</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="166.52535433" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">3.TAH + BSO + omentectomy.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="178.1503937" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">4. Biopsy from suspicious areas.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="189.77543307" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">5. may include pelvic/abdomen, para-aortic </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="7.2" y="201.40047244" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">lymphadenectomy. </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="213.02551181" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10" font-weight="700">BOT</tspan><tspan font-size="10"> =&gt; Staging laparotomy by oncologist/ </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="7.2" y="224.65055118" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">Gynaecologist according to MDT review.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="236.27559055" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">Cyst Aspiration:</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="247.90062992" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">25% sensitivity of cytological </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="258.69228346" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">examination</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="277.48393701" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">To control symptoms if Pt is unfit for </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="288.27559055" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">surgery.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="307.06724409" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">25% recurrence in 1 year after </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="317.85889764" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="10">aspiration.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><t