<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4802]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TAH </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>+</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> BSO</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4803]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>AH =&gt; TAH + BSO.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4804]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Progression:</strong></em></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4805]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Review treatment </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4806]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>AH </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TAH </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>+</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> BSO.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4807]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Endometrial</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> CA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt; oncologists.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4808]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>CA Breast + Tamoxifen:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4809]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Symptomatic or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>symptomatic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ET &gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mm refer for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hysteroscopy</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4810]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUS not recommended as prophylac</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tic treatment of EH.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4811]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tamoxifen + EH =&gt; Assess and management is conjunction with oncologist.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4812]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>given on the basis of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>EB </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>not</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> prophylactically on the basis of tamoxifen</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4813]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>AH + Fertility concerns: ¼ conceive</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="7699f252803a5b004df3cc42" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-03-010"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 7699f252803a5b004df3cc42" viewbox="847725 266700 228600 438150" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="6167f71f0999f26535559af5274730497c73b820c72f63db029325dc510eb9d4"><g data-mm-object-id="d8c01d8ce9a254aa5fa9" transform="translate(876300 273050)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 302577.5 L 39211.25 302577.5 L 39211.25 0 L 117633.75 0 L 117633.75 302577.5 L 156845 302577.5 L 78422.5 381000 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
