<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4815]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Pretreatment </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>work – up to rule out </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>co</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ncomitant</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> CA ovary and CA Endometrium</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4816]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>TVS</strong></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4817]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>MRI</strong></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4818]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CA – 125 </strong></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4819]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Hy</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>steroscopy</strong></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4820]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Once Ca endometrium and CA ovary is ruled out</strong></span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="a10ec1a8ca02b82551e07fab" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-03-010"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure a10ec1a8ca02b82551e07fab" viewbox="676275 171450 228600 447675" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="f75c90b3f298c45a36677cbece8702dfb187943d5d5d652e2dda59a8343581d7"><g data-mm-object-id="6f08b4b47aac86db49d7" transform="translate(704850 186267)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 302577.5 L 39211.25 302577.5 L 39211.25 0 L 117633.75 0 L 117633.75 302577.5 L 156845 302577.5 L 78422.5 381000 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
