<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5050]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5051]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5052]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mortality reduced to half with cervix screening.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5053]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Most common viral STI = HPV.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5054]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Warts = </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HPV </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6,11</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5055]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Cervix</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HPV </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>16,18</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5056]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Age for screening:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 24.5 – 6</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> years</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5057]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Recall:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 3 yearly 24.5 – 49years</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5058]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5 yearly 50 – 64years </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5059]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>S</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>creening of </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>immuno</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>compromised Pts:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5060]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HIV positive =&gt; Annually.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5061]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>End stage renal disease= @ diagnosis.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5062]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transplant = within 1 year.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5063]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cytotoxic drugs = @ start of treatment.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5064]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Renal dis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ease</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> on dialysis + mild </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dyskaryosis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt; urgent </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>referral for</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> colposcopy.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5065]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
