<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5144]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Treatmen</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>t:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5145]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Ablative procedure:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5146]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Cold coagulation under local </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Anaesthesia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> @ 120</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5147]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Cryocautry – freeze under local Anaesthesia</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5148]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Laser – vaporization under L/A.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5149]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Excisional</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong> procedure</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5150]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>LLETZ – 7mm by Diathermy loop.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5151]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Laser </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>cone </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>under</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> local anesthesia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5152]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Knife cone – CGIN – GA.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5153]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Hysterectomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>line</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5154]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Hysterectomy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5155]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Biopsy + colposcopy is must before TAH.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5156]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Mapping with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Lugol’s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> iodine </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>before surgery to identify VaiN.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5157]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5158]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>TYPES OF T </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ZONES</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: Area</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> between previous zone to new zone.</span></p>
