ans-serif;font-size:12pt''>.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>Remove &gt;95%</strong></u></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>10 – 15mm depth</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:93.25pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="31ddb4d7e51e1609a8dfdc46" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-03-015"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 31ddb4d7e51e1609a8dfdc46" viewbox="0 0 695325 809625" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="7c21625d638d6a0f17cbf67a6198f22929ce9afd3a2b8c0150de0d789a5e8e2a"><defs><clippath id="clip-2780d97e8430f8d08499" clippathunits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 0 0 L 714562 0 L 714562 828377 L 0 828377 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="2780d97e8430f8d08499" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-2780d97e8430f8d08499)"><image href="/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/c33bd6aa4d5783f5a346bbcaca054b5e7058010b8526e44ff923c85a49c626ff.png" x="-1555601.75381804" y="-266008.37143703" width="2331816.99517034" height="1443266.08126002" preserveaspectratio="none"></image></g></g></svg></figure></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>TZ – not fully visible endocervical portion.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>Remove &gt; 95%</strong></u></s