" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>ernal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> urethral compression.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>3. Prolapse – (Bladder outflow obstruction).</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>4. A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>contractile</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> detrusor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:141.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:18pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>3. Very High Q Max</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="16c3082e0ca1021f3cc153c1" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-04-005"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 16c3082e0ca1021f3cc153c1" viewbox="0 0 1057275 657225" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="738e11df189603dc1edda3e79be86cf068e4e7fc7f3099dc2630a6481ef59332"><defs><clippath id="clip-1595a7a747ba876c41b6" clippathunits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 0 0 L 1049530 0 L 1049530 650435 L 0 650435 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="1595a7a747ba876c41b6" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-159