<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5509]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Exercise.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5510]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>precipitating</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> factors – cough, constipation.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5511]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>1</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><u><strong>st</strong></u></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> line: </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>(Mix + OAB).</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5512]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bladder Retraining.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5513]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6weeks minimum =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>up to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5514]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Combination of medicine + Bladder Retraining if Frequency is the problem.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5515]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>2</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><u><strong>nd</strong></u></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> line:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Medical Treatment Anticholinergics.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5516]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oxybutynin – 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line, Avoid in old </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>age due to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CNS effects.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5517]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tropsium – suitable for old </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CNS </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>problem</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> cross BBB</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5518]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Darifenacin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – suitable for old.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5519]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tolterodine.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5520]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transdermal: if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>women</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> can’t tolerate orally or severe S/E.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5521]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mirabegron</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: B</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>3</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Agonist</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>avoid in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>uncontrolled HTN.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5522]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>              </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S/E = Eyelid edema, Rash, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tachycardia</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5523]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Desmopressin = nocturia avoid </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>if age is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 65 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> HTN</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5524]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em>S/E of Anti </em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em>Muscarinic</em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5525]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dry mouth</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>88%,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>constipation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> blurred vision</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5526]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dry eye, urinary retention.</span></p>
