<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5574]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neurostimulation:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5575]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t offer </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>transcutaneous</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sacral nerve.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5576]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stimulation (TENS).</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5577]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t offer </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>transcutaneous</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> post tibial nerve stimulation.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5578]" style="padding-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t offer Percutaneous post tibial nerve stimulation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>its least invasive.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5579]" style="margin-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Until:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5580]" style="padding-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Local MDT decides.</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="ee03f0a3871513cff74642c4" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-04-008"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure ee03f0a3871513cff74642c4" viewbox="676275 28575 276225 1495425" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="8708324771d12ff0d69116ba9621911f803fb00798aab87b3c49171874d8fd97"><g data-mm-object-id="41e724c508804c23483a" transform="translate(711006 44367)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 1317514 L 52884.5 1317514 L 52884.5 0 L 158653.5 0 L 158653.5 1317514 L 211538 1317514 L 105769 1423283 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
