<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5855]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Acquired:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5856]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Genetic pre</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>disposition.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5857]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3 times</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> more in Black.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5858]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Assisted birth.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5859]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Commonly at </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4 and 8’o clock position.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5860]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Saddle bag/ Horse shoe shape.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5861]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Presentation:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Classical </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Triad</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5862]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>       </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>       Post void </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dribbling</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="3b392c58d684b00f00b9d560" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-04-013"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 3b392c58d684b00f00b9d560" viewbox="1485900 104775 1009650 476250" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="08e82f78b93ef0e8a9766e120e67c5485999cdf981753c4345dd3fb3b0e8b8d1"><g data-mm-object-id="28a03d31075e056fe397" transform="translate(1517650 133985)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 425450 L 466725 0 L 933450 425450 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#70AD47" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5863]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5864]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>       </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dyspareunia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>                               Dysuria</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5865]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>LUTS:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5866]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lower urinary Tract symptoms 40 – 100%.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5867]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Frequency, Urgency, incontinence, Recurrent UTI, Vaginal mass, discharge.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5868]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Examination:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5869]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tender mass anteriorly 2 – 3cm inside introitus.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5870]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Purulent</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> discharge on palpation 25%.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5871]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Malignant change/ calculi:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5872]" style="padding-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Firm, irregular mass with induration + blood.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5873]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Investigations:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5874]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Urethroscopy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>:</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> mucosal defect in 70% but recurrent inflammation may obscure ostia.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5875]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Urodynamic:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> all Pts.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5876]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Video cystography</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>preferred</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5877]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>MRI:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> differentiate between complex UD &amp; solid mass.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5878]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>USG:</strong></em></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5879]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>TVUSS </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>– excellent sensitivity but probe can compress directly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5880]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>TAS –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> less sensitive for UD &lt; 2cm.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5881]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Trans peri</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>n</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>eal</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> less sensitive for small UD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5882]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Transrectal</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> improve visualization.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5883]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>CT</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5884]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Micturating cystogram/ voiding cystourethrogram.</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5885]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>85 – 95% sensitivity</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5886]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Double balloon urethrogram – Gold std.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5887]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>90% accuracy.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5888]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Complications:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5889]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Abscess</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Drainage by needle, no</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>t</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> I/D.</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5890]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Recurrent UTI:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> 30 – 50%.</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5891]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Calculi:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> 1.5 – 10%, Removal @ time of excision.</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5892]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Incontinence:</strong></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5893]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neoplasm:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> 6 – 9%.</strong></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5894]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Surgery for urethral </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>diverticula</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5895]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>indication:</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5896]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Complication of UD.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5897]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Persistent symptoms.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5898]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Done by</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> urologist/ urogynaecologist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5899]"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5900]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Endoscopic deroofing or Transurethral incision:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5901]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Marsup</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>i</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>alization</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>.</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5902]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Diverticulectomy.</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5903]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Endoscopic </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>deroofing</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>OR</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Transurethral incision:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5904]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>distal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> UD </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5905]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>not </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in mid UD </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; Sphincter damage.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5906]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Converting a narrow UD neck into wide</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> neck</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to allow drainage.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5907]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>2.</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Marsuplization:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5908]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Old/ frail Pts.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5909]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of fistula.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5910]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>3.</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Diverticulectomy </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5911]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a) </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Use of flaps</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>grafts (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Martius Graft</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5912]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>70% cure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5913]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SUI + UD</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5914]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>b) </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diverticulectomy + sling.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5915]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c) </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Martius</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Graft</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5916]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> d) </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>36% recurrence</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5917]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Complications of surgery:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5918]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ncomplete excision.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5919]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>U</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5920]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stricture</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5921]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fistula</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5922]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Recurrence</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 36%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5923]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5924]"> </p>
