<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5996]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>E secreting </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pessary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> where pessary or cream application is difficult =&gt; (Estring)</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5997]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Pelvic floor exercises: PFME</strong></em></u></span></span></div>
