<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6000]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>               -</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continue if effective.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6001]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Vaginal pessaries</strong></em></u></span></span></div>
