<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6006]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Ring</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> common, with or without E, failure with deficient perineum.</span></span></div>
