bri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>/V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>ceftriaxo</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>ne</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>4 hourly.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Or </span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>Cefo</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>taxime</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> 1g -8 hourly I/V. or</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>Cipro</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>500mg </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>I/V, B.D</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>Spectino</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>mycin</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" s