<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6352]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ofloxacin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 400 B.D</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="c71797b40892541c041745eb" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-05-003"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="[14 DAYS]" viewbox="1981200 0 1123950 419100" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="3e7aa7fcba0d0cca00118f29df245a17d64728fa9f4a151c5d471b00c8c57493"><g data-mm-object-id="eeeecc8f6cc1b36671cb" transform="translate(2237105 50496)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 834390 0 L 834390 269875 L 0 269875 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="12" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">[14 </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="7.2" y="25.95" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">DAYS]</tspan></text></g></g></g></g><g data-mm-object-id="04f61ec9b39514091255" transform="translate(1996602 11430)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 45719 3809.76427 L 45719 369959.23573 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 0 373769 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path><path d="M 0 0 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 45719 3809.76427 L 45719 369959.23573 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 0 373769" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6353]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ metronidazole </span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6354]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ceftriaxone </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1g sta</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t I/M</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6355]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Az</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hro</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1g/weeks. [14 DAYS]</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6356]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oral Moxi 400 OD – [14 DAYS]</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6357]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6358]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>M-Gen</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>italium = moxi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>floxacin</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6359]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pregnancy, B.F – parental therapy.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6360]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe PID – Consider anaerobes</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6361]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Quinolones – avoided in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gonoc</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oc</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> PID due to     ing </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>resistance</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="554de95e0094312e782de8e4" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-05-003"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 554de95e0094312e782de8e4" viewbox="1276350 152400 238125 304800" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="ed1a1aa6e75e51cdfa6167ec5e3fa8ca02e7835b7c251c5cdf2bce32b764d575"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-109ec27ab1896c4e6c5d" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="109ec27ab1896c4e6c5d" transform="translate(1404620 241300)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(0 77470) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -77470)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 154940" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-109ec27ab1896c4e6c5d)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6362]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t use Quinolones as 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6363]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V in inpatient regimens should be continued 24 hours after clinical improvement.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6364]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Partner</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong> treatment:</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong> </strong></em></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6365]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>z</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>thro</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1g – single dose.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6366]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Screening in 6m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> duration</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6367]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid sexual </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>intercou</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>se</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> until index pt h</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ave completed treatment course.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6368]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>TOC:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6369]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 – 4 weeks.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6370]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CT – not routinely if indicated then after 3 – 5weeks.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6371]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>In – Patient:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6372]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Surgical Emergency can’t be excluded.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6373]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No response to therapy</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6374]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe disease</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6375]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>To Abscess</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6376]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Intolerance to oral treatment</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6377]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pregnancy</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6378]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ceftriaxone 2g daily I/v + </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doxi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> B.D.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6379]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Followed by</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6380]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doxi B.D</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="991482682b93e400d98c87d8" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-05-003"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 991482682b93e400d98c87d8" viewbox="2324100 209550 85725 419100" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="7c4523ebea09a25efcf6354cb052b87a1cf893a96442f179a1f1864df983241c"><g data-mm-object-id="81b930d59b7b3814b2ad" transform="translate(2339036 215900)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 A 45085 3756.93305 0 0 1 45085 3756.93305 L 45085 369623.06695 A 45085 3756.93305 0 0 1 0 373380 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path><path d="M 0 0 A 45085 3756.93305 0 0 1 45085 3756.93305 L 45085 369623.06695 A 45085 3756.93305 0 0 1 0 373380" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6381]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ Metronidazole B.D</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="2f5bbcb69791d75731f4ddec" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-05-003"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="[14 DAYS]" viewbox="2543175 66675 914400 333375" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="e31091e641d3734d611877fc657ef170c2c7a32001d71a34aae1d0e5967bb459"><g data-mm-object-id="a1457fc8ae0390f912c3" transform="translate(2550491 80010)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 882594 0 L 882594 277586 L 0 277586 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="12" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">[14 DAYS]</tspan></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6382]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Clinda 90mg TDS</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6383]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ Gentamycin 2mg/kg loading dose then 1.5mg/kg 1day – TDS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6384]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>F.B </span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="3b6616e1e753e17a6ce5cdab" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-05-003"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 3b6616e1e753e17a6ce5cdab" viewbox="2457450 95250 76200 781050" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="b2cfc0b8fdfdb45615d30622e2cd1bd89e606f9841878a926c206e1fcca476c2"><g data-mm-object-id="81826dc8856c587e564b" transform="translate(2468880 103367)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 45719 3809.76427 L 45719 730976.23573 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 0 734786 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path><path d="M 0 0 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 45719 3809.76427 L 45719 730976.23573 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 0 734786" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6385]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oral </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>clinda</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 45mg QDS or</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="c1da51c95034b689e8324734" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-05-003"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="[14 DAYS]" viewbox="2609850 66675 914400 323850" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="a8438abd02b8640264ea02b7460d951d145f3b137ff59900096fe2bfc09ea03f"><g data-mm-object-id="0f4ea71921b19578afad" transform="translate(2617166 73660)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 882015 0 L 882015 277495 L 0 277495 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="12" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">[14 DAYS]</tspan></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6386]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doxi 10mg B.D</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6387]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ Metronidazole</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6388]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gentamycin levels should be monitored.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6389]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V ofloxacin 400mg B.D + I/V</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6390]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Metronidazole 500mg TDS – 14days</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6391]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cipro 200 B.D + Doxi + Metronidazole TID = 14 days.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6392]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Surgical management:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6393]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Laparoscopy – divide adhesions &amp; drainage of pelvic abscess.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6394]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG Guided aspiration of fluid collection is less invasive but equally effective.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6395]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Adhesiolysis in Perihepatitis.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6396]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Follow Up:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6397]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>72 hours in moderate – severe.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6398]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Further review 2 – 4 weeks.</span></span></div>
