-wrapped-line="4" x="43.2" y="81.75" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">week of the previous packet.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="95.7" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>
