154" dy="0">More than five bleeding episodes within a reference period</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text x="154" y="63.28748031" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" data-mm-table-text-event="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7218]/w:r[1]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}AlternateContent[1]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}Choice[1]/w:drawing[1]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/wordprocessingDrawing}anchor[1]/a:graphic[1]/a:graphicData[1]/{http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2010/wordprocessingShape}wsp[1]/{http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2010/wordprocessingShape}txbx[1]/w:txbxContent[1]/w:tbl[1]/w:tr[2]/w:tc[2]/w:p[3]/w:r[1]/w:t[1]" data-mm-table-event-kind="text" x="154" dy="0">Fewer than three bleeding episodes within a reference period</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text x="154" y="82.28748031" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" data-mm-table-text-event="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7218]/w:r[1]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}AlternateContent[1]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}Choice[1]/w:drawing[1]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/wordprocessingDrawing}anchor[1]/a:graphic[1]/a:graphicData[1]/{http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2010/wordprocessingShape}wsp[1]/{http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/word/2010/wordprocessingShape}txbx[1]/w:txbxContent[1]/w:tbl[1]/w:tr[2]/w:tc[2]/w:p[4]/w:r[1]/w:t[1]" data-mm-table-event-kind="text" x="154" dy="0">Bleeding episode lasting 14 days or more</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text x="154" y="101.28748031" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" data-mm-table-text-event="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7218]/w:r[1]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}AlternateContent[1]