="43.2" y="130.7" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">If treatment refused AD</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="151.65" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">must have included </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="165.6" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">phrases</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="187.55" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">“Even if my life @ risk”.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="209.5" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>
