wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="114.7" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">acting in best interest </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="2" x="43.2" y="127.65" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12">of pt.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="148.6" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>
