<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8267]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Visualize from secondary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> port</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (5mm)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8268]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After completion check from laparoscope </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for through and through injury.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8269]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8270]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8271]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8272]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8273]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Alterate Entry Techniques:</strong></span></p>
