<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8364]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Trigone stitched</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8365]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>by identifying </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8366]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ureters and by</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8367]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>urologist consultant.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8368]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Ascending cystogram/ Retrograde:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8369]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>before removing catheter</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8370]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5% chance of </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8371]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fistula formation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8372]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If spillage of dye</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="5af538d47f521078521ae2a5" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-06-004"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 5af538d47f521078521ae2a5" viewbox="933450 28575 238125 400050" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="400f78b56e1ae4e4d3fadbc4d4958d1dd2064c08543b58e9e8c722a75bef0b8b"><g data-mm-object-id="d18c4796d783dc443165" transform="translate(968250 40125)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 261973 L 42549.5 261973 L 42549.5 0 L 127648.5 0 L 127648.5 261973 L 170198 261973 L 85099 347072 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8374]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8375]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Retain cathe</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ter</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8376]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>for another </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8377]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 week.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8378]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 13pt''><u><strong>Ureteric Injury:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8379]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&lt; 1% - 2%</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8380]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Subtotal hysterectomy = 0.6%</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8381]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Endometriosis = 21%.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8382]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Commonest site:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8383]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pelvic Brim</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8384]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lateral to cervix</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8385]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Electrocautery</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1/4</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> cases.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8386]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>12% pt have ureters &lt; 0.5cm from cervix.</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="302635deae866aabbcc6e6e6" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-06-004"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 302635deae866aabbcc6e6e6" viewbox="733425 114300 228600 304800" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="d40cfe31fee155a567acc4fbd451d8701bcb19e2fb89909a5ec444bb3894eee6"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-6788141e773ac07ac665" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="6788141e773ac07ac665" transform="translate(857250 200025)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(0 79375) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -79375)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 158750" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-6788141e773ac07ac665)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8387]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ed BMI =&gt; ureters close to cervix.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8388]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Prevention:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8389]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Knowledge of Anatomy</strong></em></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8390]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Safe electrosurgery and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>meticulous</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> technique.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8391]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MRI or IVU help surgeon to check anatomy of ureters before surgery</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8392]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Magnified View</strong></em></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8393]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>To identify uretric peristallsis.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8394]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Mobilization of ureters </strong></em></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8395]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In complex cases upto 15cm (1/2 length) </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>can be mobilized </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with out compromising blood supply.</span></span></div>
