<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9922]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Cause </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>miscarriages, premature</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> ruptured membranes</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or painless dilation.</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="73d40034c7e32c6551a53680" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-07-001"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 73d40034c7e32c6551a53680" viewbox="0 0 133350 95250" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="edf8735a06ea687241d9114f8b66eceadcdb0af169d0cc9b1f8d72f237007a35"><defs><clippath id="clip-f6071ade27dddeb1ed78" clippathunits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 0 0 L 127000 0 L 127000 93345 L 0 93345 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="f6071ade27dddeb1ed78" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-f6071ade27dddeb1ed78)"><image href="/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/c81e3f690ab90f63874d3867650b53b1d4834f973408e5292ea49c3483fa6ce0.png" x="0" y="0" width="127000" height="93345" preserveaspectratio="none"></image></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9923]" style="margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Workup:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9924]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>One </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> miscarriage or suspected C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ervical</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weakness.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9925]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG measurement of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ervix.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9926]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Serial measurements</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> from 16 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weeks</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 24weeks.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9927]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9928]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>C</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ervic</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>al</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> cerclage</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9929]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1.ultrasound indicated cerclage if length is ≤2.5mm</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9930]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2.History indicated cerclage:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9931]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>           3 or more 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> trimester miscarriages</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9932]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>           1 or more PTB</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9933]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9934]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Abdominal Cerclage:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9935]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Failed C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>erclage</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9936]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ery </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Short or scarred C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ervix</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9937]" style="margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9938]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>Inherited</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong> Thrombophilia</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><strong>:</strong></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9939]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Carrier of factor v, prothrombin gene mutation – double risk. </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9940]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Antithrombin 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>deficiency</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is rare yet most thrombogenic mutation associated with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>sporadic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> miscarriage.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9941]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thrombophilia testing may be offered to women with 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> trimester miscarriage.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9942]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Work up:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9943]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>One </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> miscarriage.</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="1e367d31907103b3950e2e56" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-07-001"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 1e367d31907103b3950e2e56" viewbox="0 0 133350 95250" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="cfebf31331c54b18200a02a938074505984f4b29a71f786253700defb5890803"><defs><clippath id="clip-55f4ef0aa316f9ec7e30" clippathunits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 0 0 L 127000 0 L 127000 93345 L 0 93345 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="55f4ef0aa316f9ec7e30" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-55f4ef0aa316f9ec7e30)"><image href="/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/c81e3f690ab90f63874d3867650b53b1d4834f973408e5292ea49c3483fa6ce0.png" x="0" y="0" width="127000" height="93345" preserveaspectratio="none"></image></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9944]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Factor </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Leiden.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9945]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Factor </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>II</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - prothrombin gene mutation</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9946]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Protein S</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> deficiency</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9947]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - 86% success</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with LMWH</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="28b8f4fa50d74fa01baeee01" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-07-001"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 28b8f4fa50d74fa01baeee01" viewbox="0 0 133350 95250" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="8bc38ae25ebb59b5ae9ed2ca769e6a8a0fabac8d386e2800dd018f9612c2aeef"><defs><clippath id="clip-d50e5ad608bc340fd1d8" clippathunits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 0 0 L 127000 0 L 127000 93345 L 0 93345 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="d50e5ad608bc340fd1d8" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-d50e5ad608bc340fd1d8)"><image href="/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/c81e3f690ab90f63874d3867650b53b1d4834f973408e5292ea49c3483fa6ce0.png" x="0" y="0" width="127000" height="93345" preserveaspectratio="none"></image></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9948]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>29% </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> aspirin (Not recommended)</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9949]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Individualized Management.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9950]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>5.</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>Endocrine Factors:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9951]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HbA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c, 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> miscarriage – workup is indicated when there is suspicion of DM but not routinely</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="ad2637bd58da6cf8f80ab74b" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-07-001"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure ad2637bd58da6cf8f80ab74b" viewbox="0 0 133350 95250" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="9188563feee78a47e581e2408502cd93aa66ff04e4369561e5a167f781e93ee5"><defs><clippath id="clip-4c3d6e06143e55d16fb2" clippathunits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 0 0 L 129540 0 L 129540 91440 L 0 91440 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="4c3d6e06143e55d16fb2" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-4c3d6e06143e55d16fb2)"><image href="/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/c10b360cd3285b08e0bfed1459165bf6bae39694de61e020eb3480fc9e956d8e.png" x="0" y="0" width="129540" height="91440" preserveaspectratio="none"></image></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9952]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  LH in PCOS – workup is not recommended.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9953]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thyroid </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ysfunction</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – workup is recommended</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9954]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Insulin in PCOS – workup is not recommended</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9955]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hyperandrogenism – workup is not recommended</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9956]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hyperprolactinemia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> has association with RPL.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9957]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>6.</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>Immunologic Factors:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9958]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No work up</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t/m recommended.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9959]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9960]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>7.</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>Infections:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9961]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BV</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt; 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> miscar</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>iages.</span></span></div>
