<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10142]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>of sperms.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- rest – tetraploid or</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10143]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-  20 – 25% - Disperm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ic</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10144]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-Diploid                             </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mosaic.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10145]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-  Androgenic.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>     </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- 2 set of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>haploid male</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &amp;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10146]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-  Chemo risk 13 – 16%.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>      Set of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Female haploid.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10147]" style="padding-left: 162pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Diagnosis </u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>p</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lacenta</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>l hyperplasia on H/P (because not all tetraploid/triploid are partial moles)</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10148]" style="margin-left: 108pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>-  chemo risk 0.5 – 1%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10149]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Risk factors:</strong></u></span></p>
