ory polyarthropathy, </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="2" x="7.2" y="74.93740157" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">nephrotic syndrome, type I DM with nephropathy, </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="3" x="7.2" y="87.72488189" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">sickle cell disease, current IVDU. (3)</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="100.5123622" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Any surgical procedure e.g. appendectomy. (3)</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="113.29984252" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">OHSS (first trimester only). (4)</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="127.08732283" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>
