<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11764]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>48 hours after I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dose</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11765]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>72 hours after I/M</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="45f1637a0e52e323511a4582" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-08-006"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 45f1637a0e52e323511a4582" viewbox="923925 -47625 228600 466725" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="0dfda1a2f4fe701109fa05a5083b25e85361dc87a897d4bc403cd53572796a8a"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-cb20435e8ba58d46a5a0" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="cb20435e8ba58d46a5a0" transform="translate(1046480 4021)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 296333" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-cb20435e8ba58d46a5a0)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11767]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Further dose of Anti D, If not neutralized.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11768]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Repeated event of Sensitization:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11769]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Within 6 weeks of Anti – D = FMH testing 2 weekly to guide future d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ses.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11770]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 6 weeks = Repeat Anti – D + FMH.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11771]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Alloimmunization</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11772]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Without Anti – D 16%.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11773]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>With P/Natal Anti – D 2%.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11774]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>RAADP = 0.17 – 0.28%.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11775]"> </p>
