run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>@ diagnosis then every 2 weeks.</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:90.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>@ diagnosis then every 2 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:63.45pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="fad9333d7efaed7387ca4641" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-08-008"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure fad9333d7efaed7387ca4641" viewbox="4200525 -3562350 114300 1181100" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="5f635a7916eeab5f14a2e699e49959673edd2fb6db74cc18b7f20a86860bdf7c"><g data-mm-object-id="48c55a156a18379f6e78" transform="translate(4213225 -3552118)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 74930 1145540 A 74930 6243.9169 0 0 1 0 1139296.0831 L 0 6243.9169 A 74930 6243.9169 0 0 1 74930 0 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path><path d="M 74930 1145540 A 74930 6243.9169 0 0 1 0 1139296.0831 L 0 6243.9169 A 74930 6243.9169 0 0 1 74930 0" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>CTG</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:56.8pt;border-top:0.5pt s