<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12126]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Male fetus – informed choices.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12127]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If PND not perform</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ed – consider as affected fetu</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12128]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Factor levels:</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12129]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Check at booking, before invasive procedure and in 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  -</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Target – 0.5I/ml</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="d464f15851463c5593baf2ea" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-08-010"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Female gender" viewbox="0 0 4648200 819150" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="a1775219a65a3a4da6aa01ecf19e2b1eebaaccb02969f190656c06ffb20f380c"><defs><clippath id="clip-6a334ea4c91c41fd4962" clippathunits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 0 0 L 120015 0 L 120015 97790 L 0 97790 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="6a334ea4c91c41fd4962" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-6a334ea4c91c41fd4962)"><image href="/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/866549440181cb5999a3a2f1bc4156e1e0db1172ad3b89b5e1e2b13d8f0bd057.png" x="0" y="0" width="120015" height="97790" preserveaspectratio="none"></image></g></g><g data-mm-object-id="fcea19863274235af2f1" transform="translate(3460590 126375)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(591502.5 341630) rotate(270) scale(1 1) translate(-591502.5 -341630)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1183005 0 L 1183005 683260 L 0 683260 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="none" stroke-opacity="0" stroke-width="6350"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="12" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="12" fill="#EE0000">Female gender</tspan></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12130]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If t</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>reatment </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is given then</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> target</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1U/ml.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12131]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT includes neonatologist and obstetrician.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12132]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Acute Bleeding:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12133]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tran</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>examic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> acid</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> all women</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12134]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In combination o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>f</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> factor VIII if levels are</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &lt; 0.5.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12135]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Solely if &gt; 0.5.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12136]" style="margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in all procedures until Bleeding settles.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12137]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Desmopressin</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> (DDAVP)</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12138]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DDAVP</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   level VIII but not IX via V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> receptors on endotheli</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>al cells.</span></span></div>
