<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12687]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>bpm between 18 – 28 weeks</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>     </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''>block 2-3% of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 7pt''>Ant</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 7pt''>i</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>                                        </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>RO Anti LA</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12688]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Recurrence is 16%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12689]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neonatal Lupus: </strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12690]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After UV exposure 2 weeks after birth up to 3 – 6weeks </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12691]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rarely Neonatal lupus with heart block.</span></span></div>
