<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12908]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Abd X – RAY: </strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12909]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Colonic dilatation and Acute severe colitis.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12910]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>CT:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>not done routinely </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12911]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Gastro</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>scopy, Colonoscopy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>, Sigmoidoscopy:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12912]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Safe.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12913]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pre – pregnancy counselling:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12914]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mycophenolate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> mofetil, Metho stop 3m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12915]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Nutritional Supplements:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12916]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vitamin B</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>12</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, D, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>proteins</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, fats, iron folate.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12917]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12918]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Correct prior to conception.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12919]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Drugs:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12920]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Amino salicylates:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> category B drug</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12921]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Up to 3g/day =&gt; fetal nephrotoxic.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12922]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>High dose folic acid, 5mg.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12923]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bloody diarrhea in infants with mesalazine.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12924]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Metro</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>nidazole</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> In perineal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Crohn’s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> disease + initial flare.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12925]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Steroids:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> hydrocortisone during labor.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12926]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Azathioprine:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>safe</strong></em></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12927]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Calcineurin</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> inhibitors:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> fulminant colitis.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12928]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Biologics:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> avoid live vaccination in babies until levels are undetectable.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12929]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Mycoph</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>e</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>nola</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>te:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> category X</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12930]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Metho:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> category X</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12931]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Labor &amp; Delivery:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12932]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid episiotomy in perianal disease.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12933]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Elective CS is preferred over emergency CS.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12934]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Opiates =&gt; constipation so give osmotic laxative with opiates.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12935]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>VTE:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Score 3</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12936]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Post-partum depression – 3 times     risk.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="88d681124c4c4e35db117791" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-08-020"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 88d681124c4c4e35db117791" viewbox="2514600 -66675 228600 285750" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="79bc0d3d349affe505c5f03777ac7550e4920907fa7d96412c8fd49a1939472c"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-ecf7f37d2607419fb6db" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="ecf7f37d2607419fb6db" transform="translate(2638235 17780)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(0 69215) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -69215)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 138430" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-ecf7f37d2607419fb6db)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
