<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15227]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Care pathways for thyroid problems in pregnancy:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
