font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Neurological problems complications     es as TSH level      es &gt;4.5 Iu/ml:&lt;figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="a6cd7b6574624cff2b4e510a" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-08-044"&gt;&lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure a6cd7b6574624cff2b4e510a" viewBox="742950 514350 228600 447675" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="fe74ef4f090a26e2b413299e0089e4a02efddfc9bfb232bc95f63b5e368fbbc6"&gt;&lt;defs&gt;&lt;marker id="arrow-end-2424474943bd7bd70177" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="7" refX="9" refY="3.5" orient="auto" markerUnits="strokeWidth"&gt;&lt;path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;&lt;marker id="arrow-end-7933779b56e9028a3c45" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="7" refX="9" refY="3.5" orient="auto" markerUnits="strokeWidth"&gt;&lt;path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;&lt;/defs&gt;&lt;g data-mm-object-id="2424474943bd7bd70177" transform="translate(865505 760730)"&gt;&lt;g transform="translate(0 0) translate(0 69850) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -69850)"&gt;&lt;path d="M 0 0 L 1 139700" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-2424474943bd7bd70177)"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;g data-mm-object-id="7933779b56e9028a3c45" transform="translate(865505 601980)"&gt;&lt;g transform="translate(0 0) translate(0 66675) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -66675)"&gt;&lt;path d="M 0 0 L 1 133350" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-7933779b56e9028a3c45)"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;span hidden data-mm-figure-member="a6cd7b6574624cff2b4e510a" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:tbl[95]/w:tr[4]/w:tc[3]/w:p[4]/w:r[2]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}AlternateContent[1]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}Choice[1]/w:drawing[1]"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Progression to OH 2 – 6%/ year progression is more if TPOAb are positive</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Pre – eclampsia</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Hypertension</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Placental abruption</li></ul></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>Causes of IH:</strong></span></p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Obesity</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Iodine deficiency</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Iron deficiency </li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Exposure to organochloride pesticides</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:18pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>IH can cause placental Abruption.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Management:</span></p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;