olid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0F0" data-source-marker-font="Wingdings"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">⇨</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Antenatal care</li></ul><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Incremental doses in early pregnancy</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Need of incremental doses is @ around 5week so counsel the patient regarding self – increment.</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;