<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15769]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Incubation period: </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15770]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 – 3 weeks.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15771]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Infecti</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ous</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15772]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>48 hours before Rash till vesicles crust over (within 5 days).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15773]" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Varicella Zoster Contact: </strong></u></span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="06ce9908274dc81a4c8238f2" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-003"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 06ce9908274dc81a4c8238f2" viewbox="3829050 142875 47625 238125" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="efbfed0f0209029bd1519a0677ae5b3d23352dc8c4d34ea52226a2b960b5b141"><g data-mm-object-id="77320be3bbc6f2d45356" transform="translate(3843867 156210)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 182033" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15774]" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>1. Signify contact</strong></u></span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="256a249c8abffbecd63dd4b3" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-003"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Symptoms develops despite VZ IG or antiviral PEPPt presents with chicken pox.	24 – 48 hours.Contact with GPOr midwife telephonic.Avoid contact with suspectable individuals.Symptomatic treatment.OFFER:Before 24 hours of rashBefore 20 weeks.Consider:After 24 hours.After 20 weeks =&gt; symptomatic treatment only.      Avoid delivery for 7 days to reduce Neonatal risk.50% infection.23% clinical disease.Transfer antibodies to fetus.less risk of haemorrhage, neonatal VZS.Delivery within 7 days extremely hazardous.Risk of transfer of virus with spinal needle.Epidural is safe (as dura is not penetrated).Choose site with spared lesions.GA –    es respiratory morbidity.Infection before 28 weeks.Inform risk of FVS – 1%.Refer to FMU @ (16 – 20 weeks or  after 5 weeks of infection).USGAmino – PCR DNAMRI if USG abnormal." viewbox="781050 -9525 6810375 7848600" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="0203c2fb1a8ef5750a4e5e11e4db6f435ad0b31792d08703d1dc04c8c66c73d6"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-eada92d6f6cd5feaaa2d" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker><marker id="arrow-end-ce03ae5c80a9790de0c6" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker><marker id="arrow-end-ba62e2c9707a8e2d1b16" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="77edfe8a6b04e9dcf374" transform="translate(3926840 268556)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 3657600 0 L 3657600 7564120 L 0 7564120 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="none" stroke-opacity="0" stroke-width="6350"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="11" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">Symptoms develops despite VZ IG or antiviral </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="22.87086614" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">PEP</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="42.74173228" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Pt presents with chicken pox.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="63.5292126" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">    24 – 48 hours.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="84.31669291" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Contact with GP</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="61.2" y="105.10417323" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Or midwife telephonic.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="126.89165354" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="147.84165354" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Avoid contact with suspectable individuals.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="167.71251969" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">Symptomatic treatment.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="187.58338583" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">OFFER:</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="207.45425197" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" fill="#2F5496">Before 24 hours of rash</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="227.32511811" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" fill="#2F5496">Before 20 weeks.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="247.19598425" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Consider:</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="267.06685039" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" fill="#2F5496">After 24 hours.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="286.93771654" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" fill="#2F5496">After 20 weeks =&gt; symptomatic treatment only.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="306.80858268" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">      Avoid delivery for 7 days to reduce </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="318.67944882" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Neonatal risk.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="338.55031496" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" fill="#2F5496">50% infection.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="358.4211811" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" fill="#2F5496">23% clinical disease.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="378.29204724" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Transfer antibodies to fetus.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="398.16291339" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">less risk of haemorrhage, neonatal VZS.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="418.03377953" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Delivery within 7 days extremely hazardous.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="437.90464567" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Risk of transfer of virus with spinal needle.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="457.77551181" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Epidural is safe (as dura is not penetrated).</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="97.2" y="477.64637795" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Choose site with spared lesions.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="498.43385827" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">GA –    es respiratory morbidity.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="97.2" y="519.30472441" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="115.2" y="540.25472441" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700">Infection before 28 weeks</tspan><tspan font-size="11">.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="561.04220472" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Inform risk of FVS – 1%.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="580.91307087" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Refer to FMU @ (16 – 20 weeks or  after 5 </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="592.78393701" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">weeks of infection).</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="612.65480315" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">USG</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="632.52566929" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Amino – PCR DNA</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="652.39653543" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">MRI if USG abnormal.</tspan></text></g></g></g></g><g data-mm-object-id="f92848f3a203296df642" transform="translate(872067 48260)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(2209800 0) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(-2209800 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 4419600 1" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id="eada92d6f6cd5feaaa2d" transform="translate(3009900 44027)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 338666" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-eada92d6f6cd5feaaa2d)"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id="ce03ae5c80a9790de0c6" transform="translate(871644 48260)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 8467 364067" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-ce03ae5c80a9790de0c6)"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id="ba62e2c9707a8e2d1b16" transform="translate(5287433 48260)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 351367" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-ba62e2c9707a8e2d1b16)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
