ve"><tspan font-size="11">Uncertain status.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="51.65834646" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Tropical/ sub – tropical</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="25.2" y="72.5292126" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="93.4792126" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">Check Immune status.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="113.35007874" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">IG – G status – (within 24 – 48 </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="126.13755906" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">hours). </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="146.92503937" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">From booking blood – (within 40 </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="159.71251969" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">min).</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="181.5" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="203.45" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="224.4" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Ig – G +ve    ig – ve.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="245.18748031" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700">                PEP</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="126.3" y="265.97496063" text-anchor="middle" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">1. Oral antiviral as 1</tspan><tspan font-size="11" baseline-shift="super">st</tspan><tspan font-size="11"> line PEP</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="126.3" y="284.97496063" text-anchor="middle" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Acyclovir, valaciclovir can be </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="126.3" y="295.97496063" text-anchor="middle" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">given from day 7-14</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="108.3" y="314.97496063" text-anchor="middle" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">2.VZIG Given &lt;10 days:</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="325.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Of exposure.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="336.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Before rash in index case (if </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="347.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">exposure is continuous).</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="358.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">If oral not tolerable or renal </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="369.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">problem.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="380.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">Explain The woman </tspan><tspan font-size="11">that they are </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="391.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">infectious.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="61.2" y="402.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">D-8 – 28 – if VZ </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="61.2" y="413.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">immunoglobulins are given.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="61.2" y="432.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">D-8 – 21 – if not given.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="443.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">5.</tspan><tspan font-size="11" text-decoration="underline"> Re – exposure:</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="454.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">1. Check VZ igG again if negative then </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="7.2" y="465.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">give  Oral PEP or immunoglobulin</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="476.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">2. Re – dosing of VZ IG after 3 weeks.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="487.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">Postpartum vaccination:</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="498.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">2 doses 4 – 8 weeks apart.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="517.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Avoid pregnancy for 28 days </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="528.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">(live Attenuated)</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="547.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Avoid contact with suspectable </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="558.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">individuals.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="578.97496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g></g></g></g><g data-mm-object-id="15257c1584b66850589d" transform="translate(421640 80010)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1894840 0 L 1894840 4927600 L 0 4927600 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="none" stroke-opacity="0" stroke-width="6350"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="11" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">2. past history of </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="7.2" y="23.78748031" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">chicken pox.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="44.57496063" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">99% predictive </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="7.2" y="57.36244094" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">value</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="79.14992126" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="101.09992126" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="123.04992126" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="143.99992126" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Reassure, no Action.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="165.78740157" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="187.73740157" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="7.2" y="208.68740157" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-decoration="underline">Significance of contact:</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="229.47488189" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">15 min in same room.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="249.34574803" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Face to face 5 min.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="269.21661417" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Contact in large </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="281.08748031" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">ward. </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="300.95834646" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">Herperzoster. </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="320.8292126" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">If on exposed axes.</tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="43.2" y="340.70007874" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">If in immune – </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="1" x="43.2" y="352.57094488" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">compromised Pts </tspan></text></g><g transform="scale(12700)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="2" x="43.2" y="364.44181102" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"><tspan font-size="11">(ed viral sheding).</tspan></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>
