 class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><em><strong>*</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> Require one off SFH @ 28/ 40 weeks.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><em><strong>*</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> Assess women with moderate risk for abnormal placentation and start aspirin.</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:97pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><em><strong>*</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><em><strong> </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Serial USG from 32 weeks.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><em><strong>*</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><em><strong> </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Every 4 weeks till delivery.</span></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="9" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:133.7pt;border-top:0.5pt solid currentColor;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>High Risk:</strong></span></p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0F0" data-source-marker-font="Wingdings"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">⇨</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Medical conditions:
