<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18685]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 108pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal bladder</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18686]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 108pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DVP.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>2 weekly</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18687]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 108pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UA, Doppler UAPI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18688]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Complicated MC twining:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18689]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All cases managed with FMU</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18690]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>1. </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>TTTS:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18691]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of TTTS is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>15% </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18692]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>screening by </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NT is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>not recommended</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18693]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>most commonly due to abnormal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>AV – Anastomosis.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18694]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Symptoms:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sudden    in abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Girth, Breathlessness.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="b2a49d16273f2329e05fcef9" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-023"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure b2a49d16273f2329e05fcef9" viewbox="2047875 -66675 228600 276225" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="8073b32a42c7307b8ac7a4e839bcf40b5252f75fbf47dd0e1c8f460fb472e79d"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-dc609f03105917bea29e" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="dc609f03105917bea29e" transform="translate(2172335 25328)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(0 57785) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -57785)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 115570" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-dc609f03105917bea29e)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18695]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Screening</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>16</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weeks onwards.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18696]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Diagnosis:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> History + USG findings </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18697]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Severity = </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Quintero</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Classification:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18698]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage I:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> discordant Amniotic Fluid:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18699]" style="margin-left: 126pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&lt; 2cm in donor</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18700]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 126pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 8cm in recipient</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18701]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 126pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 10 after 20 weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18702]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage II:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Bladder of donor twin not seen.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18703]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage III:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Doppler is abnormal</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18704]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Arterial </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>changes</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in donor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18705]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Venous changes in recipient</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18706]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage IV:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Hydrops</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> recipient</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> twin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18707]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage V:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> IUD </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>of 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or both twins.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18708]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18709]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Before 26 weeks:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18710]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> laser ablation by Solomon technique</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18711]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>F</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>ollow up</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weekly for 2 weeks [ USG (Brain, heart, limb) Doppler, UPAI, MCA PSV]</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18712]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Then 2 weekly</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Doppler + Growth.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18713]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>S/E:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> functional heart problems.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18714]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>After 26 weeks</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – septostomy/ </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Amnioreduction</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18715]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Delivery</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> @</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 34 – 36+6 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18716]"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18717]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>SGR:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18718]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>10 – 15% alone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18719]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>50% with TTTS.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18720]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>FMU</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> referral</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> large A – A anastomosis.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18721]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>EFW</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em> measurement</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> from 20 weeks USG.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18722]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Discordance:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18723]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Larger Twin – smaller Twin</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> x 100 = Growth </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Larger twin</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>     discordance. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18724]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>         </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 20%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18725]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Stages of SGR:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18726]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage I:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> G</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rowth discordance</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> but positive diastolic flow in both UA.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18727]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage II:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> G.D with absent/ Reverse diastolic flow.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18728]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage III:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> G.D with cyclical UA diastolic flow.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18729]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Positive =&gt; absent =&gt; reverse.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="96e12be72d67e28b4edf529a" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-023"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 96e12be72d67e28b4edf529a" viewbox="1047750 76200 1419225 381000" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="79bf759ef26f117115805fe02137c191b6e0059b3485d932ed6f1743c1031795"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-555021e1d1b2cdcdd0de" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="6db30113e42021aa2f72" transform="translate(2419109 197823)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(0 83916.5) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -83916.5)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 167833" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id="555021e1d1b2cdcdd0de" transform="translate(1169043 163099)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(0 115746.5) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -115746.5)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 231493" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-555021e1d1b2cdcdd0de)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
