<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18735]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Selective reduction by vascular occlusion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18736]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Type I</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 34 – 36weeks.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="bce5d039ad2cbc8c20b47b35" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-023"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure bce5d039ad2cbc8c20b47b35" viewbox="800100 95250 133350 19050" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="186609e27fbdf1488d1895606f74515d3b7780405f50e62dd188cfc460c73d3a"><g data-mm-object-id="61d2f2ad0cddffc3ce34" transform="translate(815546 104272)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 105915 1" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18737]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18738]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Type II, </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>III</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> @</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>32weeks.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18739]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Longer latency than DC twins.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18740]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>D</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Doppler</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> showing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> reverse flow</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18741]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abnormal CTG =&gt; Consider delivery.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18742]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of unpredictable </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>transfusional</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> events.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18743]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18744]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>TAPS:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18745]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Incidence:</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2% alone and 13% in treated </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18746]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Commonly due to Minuscule A –V anastomosis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18747]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Postnatal diagnosis </u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18748]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>      </u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>TTTS Reticulocytosis</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u> difference </u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>1.7 or</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u> </u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18749]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb difference &gt; 8 g/dl</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>        </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18750]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Screening after treatment</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of TTTS and SGR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18751]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>17% risk of TAPS after laser of TTTS, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Solomon technique</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>    risk of TAPS (3%).</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="9cf5c1cb5ba824a4def2f822" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-023"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 9cf5c1cb5ba824a4def2f822" viewbox="1466850 190500 238125 304800" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="ab8bb50bd86ce57aaaf1abd5b4a85474c82a9a9e1f804f44dda2818e36003a2d"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-6933dc59f53ffc7dd31d" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="6933dc59f53ffc7dd31d" transform="translate(1594672 235510)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 159026" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-6933dc59f53ffc7dd31d)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18752]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>serial monitoring by </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MCA – PSV </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18753]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>* </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment outcome poorly established.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18754]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18755]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>TRAP</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18756]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1% </span></span></div>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, "order") VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-09-023-1', 't-mm-09-023', 'document_html', '<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18757]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Due to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>large A –A </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>anast</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>omosis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18758]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">5.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Discordant Abnormalities:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18759]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urgent referral to FMU, for Karyotyping.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18760]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Meticulous</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> mapping before invasive testing.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18761]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sample both sac unless </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chorionicity</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> determined before 14 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18762]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Selective Feticide by cord ablation method</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18763]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DIC monitoring not recommended.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18764]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18765]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18766]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">6.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Single </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>intrauterine</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> death:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> sIUD</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18767]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anemia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in surviving twin</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18768]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dIUD – 15%.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18769]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neurological </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>problems in surviving twin </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>25%.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18770]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>urgent</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> referral</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> to FMU.</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18771]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MRI after 4 weeks of demise of co – twin =&gt; to rule out neurological problems.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18772]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MCA PSV – Doppler after d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>emise </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>of co – Twin =&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>to rule out</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Anemia of co – Twin.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18773]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Uncomplicated MC Twins</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: delivery 36 – 38 weeks = elective birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18774]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Monoch</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>or</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>i</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>on</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ic monoa</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>m</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>niot</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>i</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>c:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 32 – 34 weeks = elective CS.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18775]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cord entanglement.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18776]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Higher order Multiple:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18777]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Selective </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>feticide</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> including triplets.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18778]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">7.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Conjoined Twins:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18779]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FMU, MDT management</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18780]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1/90,000 to 1/100,000 pregnancies.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18781]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Survival 25% I/U demise 10%.</span></span></div>
