t-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><em><strong>Quadruple</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><em><strong>:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> after 15 weeks.</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>9. Identify genital mutation.</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>10. Ask about past/ present mental health illness, depression.</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>11. Occupation – identify occupational hazards.</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>12. Support @ home – rule out domestic abuse, deprivation.</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>@ 16 weeks</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-