<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19690]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><u><strong>LABOUR AND DELIVERY:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19691]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>INTRAPARTUM CARE OF HEALTHY NORMAL PREGNANCIES</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19692]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>1.1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>BIRTH SETTING</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19693]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>1.2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>LABOUR ANALGESIA AND </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>ANA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>E</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>STHESIA </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>(</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Lucida Handwriting", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Dr. ASIF ALI</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>) </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19694]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>1.3. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>ST</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> STAGE OF LABOR AND MANAGEMENT OF ITS DELAY</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19695]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>1.4. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>nd </sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>STAGE OF LABOR AND MANAGEMENT OF ITS DELAY</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19696]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>1.5. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> STAGE OF LABOR AND MANAGEMENT OF ITS DELAY</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19697]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>1.6. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>RETAINED PLACENTA</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19698]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>1.7. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>OST PARTUM HAEMORRHAGE</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19699]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>1.8. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>CARE OF WOMEN AFTER BIRTH</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19700]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NEONATAL CARE AND RESUSCITATION </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Lucida Handwriting", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(Dr. NAILA HAMID)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19701]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NTRAPARTUM CARE OF WOMAN WITH EXISTING MEDICAL CONDITIONS AND OBSTETRIC COMPLICATIONS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19702]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>3.1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>HEART DISEASE</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>S</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19703]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>3.2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>ASTHMA</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19704]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>3.3. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>WOMAN ON LONG TERM SYSTEMIC STEROIDS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19705]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>3.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>4. BLEEDING</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> DISORDERS ITP</span></p>
