<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20073]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="085dbbdea524ffde32844435" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-004"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 085dbbdea524ffde32844435" viewbox="6276975 -19050 247650 361950" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="2ba1190397b0364e3e64b69c3b0b530e8da326424a0914b332940af1a0e7c506"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-7ef346694761a05dee16" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="7ef346694761a05dee16" transform="translate(6403975 30290)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 6985 200660" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-7ef346694761a05dee16)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20075]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20076]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Delay in 1</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><strong>st</strong></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> stage of labor is suspected when:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20077]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cervical dilatation &lt; 2cm in 4 hours.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20078]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Descent and rotation of baby’s head is delayed</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20079]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Change in strength, duration and frequency of contraction.</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="94a9c8415dda8a995b0b1921" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-004"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 94a9c8415dda8a995b0b1921" viewbox="1085850 19050 266700 390525" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="c12536150f8a23efcd65bc4cce7c632ad14f587241e1a02542342e80eb23dd53"><g data-mm-object-id="0c35f05aeef4b76164c2" transform="translate(1115291 33770)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 225136.5 L 50222.75 225136.5 L 50222.75 0 L 150668.25 0 L 150668.25 225136.5 L 200891 225136.5 L 100445.5 325582 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#0070C0" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20081]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20082]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Full assessment by knowing parity, uterine contraction, cervical dilation and rate of change, station and position of presenting part.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="aa2482e96d3d15f5321b22ed" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-004"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure aa2482e96d3d15f5321b22ed" viewbox="1104900 28575 266700 381000" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="631763d3f9d2a187e45e5bb631c4d414a04232b51bd0d9e316175ace88caa2aa"><g data-mm-object-id="03e852d15971ba5582ca" transform="translate(1135842 40640)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 225136.5 L 50222.75 225136.5 L 50222.75 0 L 150668.25 0 L 150668.25 225136.5 L 200891 225136.5 L 100445.5 325582 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#0070C0" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20084]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20085]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer support and effective pain relief</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="697a6c4b64d2558437ec894b" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-004"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 697a6c4b64d2558437ec894b" viewbox="1123950 304800 276225 390525" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="3dbcce949030c1cf542c8b39ef338ac937812409862c2910ed7607681f1e76f2"><g data-mm-object-id="338e865d785028fee066" transform="translate(1156335 318770)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 225136.5 L 50222.75 225136.5 L 50222.75 0 L 150668.25 0 L 150668.25 225136.5 L 200891 225136.5 L 100445.5 325582 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#0070C0" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20086]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20087]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20088]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20089]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20090]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Repeat examination after 2 hours</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20091]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Suspect delay if dilation &lt; 1 cm</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="1ebef9d91bc183db5b99bb13" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-004"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 1ebef9d91bc183db5b99bb13" viewbox="1143000 28575 266700 390525" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="50fadfe2e2e7ce80f12fa9e9b48ec5f1982d59b4980062b55176c98df6bf3856"><g data-mm-object-id="bf7880748303d34e277d" transform="translate(1170478 41852)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 225136.5 L 50222.75 225136.5 L 50222.75 0 L 150668.25 0 L 150668.25 225136.5 L 200891 225136.5 L 100445.5 325582 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#0070C0" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20093]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20094]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer amniotomy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20095]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Explain procedure</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20096]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Advice that it will shorten labor by an hour.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="723416638d00e13c623b8784" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-004"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 723416638d00e13c623b8784" viewbox="1143000 209550 266700 390525" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="1d8240b60c2cfa8dad117b8593936ed64ad3a00934d3a8cb78cc959dfa5e0ea2"><g data-mm-object-id="fc2e8e93a66de0856f72" transform="translate(1170305 222943)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 225136.5 L 50222.75 225136.5 L 50222.75 0 L 150668.25 0 L 150668.25 225136.5 L 200891 225136.5 L 100445.5 325582 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#0070C0" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20097]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20098]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20099]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Repeat examination after 2 hours</strong></span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="4853f44fe21dccd8af1cafd6" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-004"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 4853f44fe21dccd8af1cafd6" viewbox="2000250 161925 66675 247650" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="373b42cce73336ae129b1d4527ebe827491dfdc4b9364defb07d49da19f5ab20"><g data-mm-object-id="74b4033631902f72baa0" transform="translate(2014220 168720)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 195263" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
