<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20259]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20260]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Escalate senior review</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20261]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transfer of care if needed with full protocols</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20262]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer support to women</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="250ab020a67525302989375c" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-005"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 250ab020a67525302989375c" viewbox="1162050 47625 276225 428625" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="baddf0f30bceda5111aed45fcfb2f71b7b8626d173d137e2605c3a6545cee3a3"><g data-mm-object-id="99bb5c4ffc4de5ed4f78" transform="translate(1196436 63295)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 253706 L 52855.5 253706 L 52855.5 0 L 158566.5 0 L 158566.5 253706 L 211422 253706 L 105711 359417 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20264]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20265]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In person review by obstetrician including</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20266]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal well being</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20267]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Maternal well being</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20268]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Confirmation that there are no signs of obstructed labo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>u</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20269]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Confirmation that contractions are infrequent or ineffective</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="7f20b2a222d8e4cb61af1fe9" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-005"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 7f20b2a222d8e4cb61af1fe9" viewbox="1333500 28575 276225 419100" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="da570f26bd51a70ba1248e6b0e389e6a68cac8bbebc80df360b7230787d0354c"><g data-mm-object-id="faabad9b687038031f77" transform="translate(1365026 36830)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 253706 L 52855.5 253706 L 52855.5 0 L 158566.5 0 L 158566.5 253706 L 211422 253706 L 105711 359417 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
