<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20272]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Start oxytocin after obstetrician’s decision with protocols of oxytocin</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="cede81caf0975494b4476029" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-005"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure cede81caf0975494b4476029" viewbox="1343025 28575 276225 419100" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="6c2fe9e0a78475aefeec19f32e822b891a66787597a90fcd550223c7b2e9ed84"><g data-mm-object-id="6860012e8a71953f5524" transform="translate(1376251 40005)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 254000 L 52705 254000 L 52705 0 L 158115 0 L 158115 254000 L 210820 254000 L 105410 359410 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20274]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20275]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Review every 15 – 30 min.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="598ad2dada71fe5bae0fd3c4" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-005"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 598ad2dada71fe5bae0fd3c4" viewbox="1352550 19050 266700 428625" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="c2711ffb6d8fd299c508d8a5bac2f7f8f3e7464f3e451dddff029eec9c7f5ac7"><g data-mm-object-id="11cffb6a1bcf18397f07" transform="translate(1381554 33655)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 254000 L 52705 254000 L 52705 0 L 158115 0 L 158115 254000 L 210820 254000 L 105410 359410 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20277]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20278]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Still no delivery or progress within normal duration</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20279]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Discuss with women and her partner</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20280]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Decide whether to go for ventouse, forceps or C/S</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20281]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Decision of intervention on </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>individualized</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> basis</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20282]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Decide degree of urgency according to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetomaternal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> conditions</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20283]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Record time of discussion.</span></span></div>', 1);

