<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21141]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 216pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IA more frequently (carry out IA after 3 consecutive contractions)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21142]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 216pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Carry out full review.</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="6cc0b9265252ce00aa5b5a23" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-028"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 6cc0b9265252ce00aa5b5a23" viewbox="3257550 114300 247650 419100" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="27cbc30c79f2c7e16dc0744162c9ce29d5887743d64db236d52579f9db6539c4"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-ade789b4114b8ea7b31a" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="ade789b4114b8ea7b31a" transform="translate(3378200 162560)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 6350 273050" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-ade789b4114b8ea7b31a)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21143]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 216pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21144]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 216pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FHR concerns are confirmed</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="6bcab678839aff8737957114" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-028"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 6bcab678839aff8737957114" viewbox="3248025 -38100 247650 581025" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="5f853a3a3ebf7efe734a89f47c93358fb886dd7efb76557bf2bec9b5f014b1ea"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-c423f552b79d4841f57d" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="c423f552b79d4841f57d" transform="translate(3370318 15389)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 4557 412376" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-c423f552b79d4841f57d)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21146]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 216pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21147]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 216pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Summon help</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21148]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 216pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continuous CTG and explain to women and her companion</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21149]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 216pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transfer to Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> unit</span></p>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="941c2a237240ecdd82c8446a" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-028"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 941c2a237240ecdd82c8446a" viewbox="3790950 161925 66675 190500" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="8ef5a4c1f235143ce4b9afb78c6f285bca7ca0c7783f7de8cf67b5a27f2b1f53"><g data-mm-object-id="5b6d90e20cbf76581071" transform="translate(3804920 173430)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 4482 152400" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
