<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21284]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21285]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">185.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obtain further urgent review</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21286]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">186.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Evaluate whole clinical picture</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21287]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">187.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expedite birth</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21288]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">188.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Document the timing of seeking review and making decision.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21289]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Acute Bradycardia or single Prolonged Deceleration for 3 min or more:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21290]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">189.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urgent obstetric review</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21291]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">190.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acute event – Expedite birth</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21292]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">191.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Underlying causes – undertake conservative measures</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21293]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">192.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Make preparations for urgent birth including a request for pediatric or neonatal support</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21294]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>[</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Bradycardia</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>]</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span></p>
