<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21594]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CTG</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21595]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Intermittent</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21596]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Scalp electrodes</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21597]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Before 34 weeks don’t offer unless</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21598]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 108pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a) No other alternative acceptable</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21599]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>b</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>) Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is involved</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21600]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 126pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c) CTG not possible by ext</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ernal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> electrode</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21601]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 126pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>d) Benefits are </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>more than</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Risks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21602]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- FBS: 34 – 36</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weeks = discuss</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21603]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Before 34 weeks don’t offer</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21604]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 108pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>34 – 36</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weeks – discuss benefits &gt; Risks.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21605]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">265.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal monitoring @ 23 – 25</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weeks = involve obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in decision making how to monitor and whether to monitor or not </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21606]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">266.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>MOD </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>– discuss</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21607]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Breach @ 26 – 36 + 6 =&gt; LSCS</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21608]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">267.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Cord Clamping</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - &gt; 30sec but &lt; 3 min.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21609]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
