<h2 class="mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21673]" style="background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>9.</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>VBAC</strong></span></h2>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21674]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><strong>Success of VBAC after 1 C/S</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21675]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>1. VBAC </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>After</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong> C/S due to malpresentation </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>=&gt; 84% </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>successful</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21676]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>2. Fetal distress &gt; 73%</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21677]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>3. Dystocia &gt; 64%</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21678]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>4. 70% after 1 LSCS</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21679]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>5.90% after </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>at least</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong> 1 SVD</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21680]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>6. plan of birth @ 3</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>6 weeks</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong> should be made</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21681]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>7. Plan of labour before decided </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>elective </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>CS should be written.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21682]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>8. 10% scheduled </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>elective </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>CS go into labour before 39 weeks’ </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21683]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>9. Asymptomatic dehiscence = 48%</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21684]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>10. Rupture case fatality = 1.3%</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21685]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>11. </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>Tr</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>i</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>ad</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong> of rupture</strong></u></span></p>
