<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22076]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Caput:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> S/C extra periosteal serosanguineous fluid collection</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22077]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Cephalohematoma:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sup periosteal, well defined, commonly don’t cross midline</span></p>
