<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22083]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Malpractice</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> litigation – failure to dis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>continue</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22084]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Serious neonatal injuries – excessive pulls &gt;3 with forceps and prolong application - &gt;12min.</span></span></div>
