(#arrow-end-b1de0ed25d81041989bd)"></path></g></g></svg></figure><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Buffering capacity acidosis more likely</span></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Difficult intubation</span></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="3345" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>Other changes:</strong></u></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Gastric mortality</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Lower esophageal sphincter</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Uterus </span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Weight</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="30969748d79b5a5cd1cb6d0a" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-038"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 30969748d79b5a5cd1cb6d0a" viewbox="1419225 -19050 228600 323850" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="4397475ff2ebdf9b80830ff42e3b00d4bcc8de95c3be4f4dc5d741e1268103df"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-94da7341abca1e156cb8" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="94da7341abca1e156cb8" transform="translate(1540510 31433)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 171450" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-94da7341abca1e156cb8)"></path></g></g></svg></figure></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Relaxed</span></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Enlarged</span></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="16752d3e81613e9d2f035ae8" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-038"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 16752d3e81613e9d2f035ae8" viewbox="1390650 123825 247650 304800" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="9db4ca07225f75c240550a24464fdbfd94756167dc68c86c65d50675671684d7"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-46414a6d9c9b48ea56a7" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="46414a6d9c9b48ea56a7" transform="translate(1516698 210820)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(2381 73819) rotate(0) scale(-1 -1) translate(-2381 -73819)"><path d="M 0 0 L 4762 147638" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-46414a6d9c9b48ea56a7)"></path></g></g></svg></figure></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Aspiration risk</span></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Early intubation with cuffed and tubes, laryngeal airway cause trauma and bleeding.</span></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Diaphragmatic splinting ventilation difficult</span></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>intubation difficult.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22361]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22362]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22363]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22364]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22365]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22366]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22367]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22368]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22369]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22370]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Identification of impending Collapse:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22371]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">368.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obstetric MEW score chart – all women under observation to allow early recognition.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22372]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">369.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Miss unwell women</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22373]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Causes of collapse </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>and their management (</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>4T,4H</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>)</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22374]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>VTE</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> – most common cause of maternal death</strong></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22375]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>H</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>aemorrhage</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 6/1000, among most common causes of direct maternal death.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22376]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>AF embolism</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22377]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7/10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>0,0</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>00, Mortality 67/1000</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22378]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Presents during labour, birth or within 30 min of birth.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22379]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Collapse, Hypotension, Respiratory distress, Hypoxia.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22380]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Coagulopathy if mother survives, d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ue to complement activation.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22381]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Treatment: </u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22382]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">370.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Supportive treatment after Resuscitation</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22383]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">371.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Involvement of obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>h</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ematologist, Anesthetist, inten</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>sivist (Senior)</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22384]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">372.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early aggressive treatment of coagulopathy including FFP</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22385]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">373.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rFVII used if coagulopathy not corr</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ected with massive blood component replacement.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22386]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">374.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rFV</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>II – associated with poor outcome</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22387]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Cardiac D</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>isease</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22388]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">375.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Most common cause of indirect death</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22389]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">376.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1/5</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dies during transfer in ambulance/ ER.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22390]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">377.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Majority of deaths has no previous history</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22391]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">378.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Main causes </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>of death are </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>arrythmia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and ischemia with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>structurally</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> normal heart</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22392]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Ehler Danlos:</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> inter scapular pain, wider pulse pressure </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>due to systolic HTN, cardiac </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>murm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ur</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22393]" style="margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22394]" style="margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22395]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Treatment:</u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22396]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">379.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After resuscitation – Expert cardiologist evaluation</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22397]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">380.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thrombolysis =&gt; cause placental size bleeding but should be given with acute </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>coronary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> insufficiency.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22398]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">381.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Percutaneous angioplasty – safe in pregnancy</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22399]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Drug Toxicity/ Overdose:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22400]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Mgso</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>4</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>;</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22401]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 10ml of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 10%</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> ca Glucona</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>te is given when toxicity is suspected</span></p>', 2);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, "order") VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-10-038-3', 't-mm-10-038', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22402]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Local Anesthetics:</u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22403]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Due to high plasma concentration of local anaesthetic OR I/V injection </strong></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22404]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S/S</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22405]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Light headedness, sedation, </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>circumoral</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> paresthesia, twitching, seizures.</strong></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22406]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe toxicity: S/S</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sudden loss of consciousness with or without consciousness or Cardiovascular compromises with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>arrythmia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22407]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Treatment:</u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22408]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">382.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stop injection</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>still not stable</span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="1f7acaff910589bbfe3c6579" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-038"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 1f7acaff910589bbfe3c6579" viewbox="2619375 19050 76200 1695450" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="c0c267b3f3add51800ce443dad8815819915af8b38c032f0ebc081176f819758"><g data-mm-object-id="40af055f54e7bd229a5d" transform="translate(2628477 28787)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 45719 3809.76427 L 45719 1659890.23573 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 0 1663700 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path><path d="M 0 0 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 45719 3809.76427 L 45719 1659890.23573 A 45719 3809.76427 0 0 1 0 1663700" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22409]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">383.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lipid Rescue </span></span></div>
<figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="89d5208ccdf0688ac5007291" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-038"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 89d5208ccdf0688ac5007291" viewbox="2867025 -9525 200025 295275" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="e534837c46ae84a99a2f0c1f1a8b531fc3cfac23985fab28abb890315dfbf370"><g data-mm-object-id="194884bedea6b9598185" transform="translate(2900680 4363)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 165226 L 30555.5 165226 L 30555.5 0 L 91666.5 0 L 91666.5 165226 L 122222 165226 L 61111 226337 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22410]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bolus = 1.5mg/kg</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Repeat Bolus</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22411]" style="margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Over 1min</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(max [3]) </span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22412]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Infusion 15mg/kg/hr</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(5 min apart)</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Double </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>infusion</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>30m/kg/hr</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>(5 min apart).</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22413]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">384.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Intra lipid 20% should be available </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22414]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">385.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All cases reported to NHS </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22415]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>M</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>echanism of action:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22416]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">386.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lipid sink</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22417]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">387.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Inhibit L/A inhibition of myocardial fatty acid oxidation.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22418]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Anaphylaxis:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22419]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>M</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>st cell tryptase levels – 1-2 hours after anaphylaxis, 3 samples</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22420]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 – 3.5/100,000 with 1% mortality.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22421]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Treatment:</u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22422]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">388.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Remove agents </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22423]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">389.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ABCDE</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22424]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">390.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Adrenaline 1:1000 – 0.5ml =&gt; I/M</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22425]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1:10,000 – 0.5ml =&gt; I/V</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22426]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Adjuvant</u></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Hydrocortisone</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 20mg.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chlorpheniramine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 10mg.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22427]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ICH:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22428]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>due to systolic HTN, aneurysm, AVM </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22429]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Managed by Neuroradiology’s &amp; Neurosurgeon.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22430]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>', 3);

