<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22985]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe pain is hallmark, interfere mobility, pain can be perineal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>abdominal</span></span></div>
