<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22993]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tender, fluctuant mass</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22994]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>R</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>igh</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t side</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> most commonly affected </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22995]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>can be up to 15cm and can extend up to groin</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22996]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Check </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HR, RR, B.P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and suspected hemodynamic compromise</span></span></div>
