<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23153]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Mental Health History:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23154]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Rapo Building:</strong></span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23155]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>By introductory sentences like pregnancy, delivery and taking care of baby can be difficult in women’s life and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>it’s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> common to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>feel</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> low </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>upset. Most women are hesitant to speak about their feelings, fears and condition.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23156]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Exploratory Questions:</strong></span></span></div>
